Let's see. You get 1/10 water daemons per fountain and (20-dlvl)/100
wishes per daemon. So for n fountains/level (anybody got a good
approximation here?) you have n*19/100 wishes from randomly generated
fountains. Additionally there are the 4 oracle fountains (2/5 daemons,
66/400 wishes/daemon=33/500 wishes) and the 2 minetown fountains (4/30
daemons each due to dryup warning with approximately (sorry, only
inserted level 7 here) 13/100 wishes/daemon=13/750).

All in all we get (n*285+125)/1500 wishes.

